{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0b5912a6bb0c5ee3","name":"Gambler (CL 4)","source":{"id":"source:reference-0b5912a6bb0c5ee3","title":"Gambler (CL 4)","revision":18919,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:58:34Z","sha256":"dc64c2f7be5c0b63ddea7914ff48d7244c7d1fb0685239935ee40c97fed45edc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18919","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gambler%20%28CL%204%29&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0b5912a6bb0c5ee3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Cunning and smooth, the Gambler always seems to have everything in perspective and to know exactly what they are doing. At least, that's their attitude when it comes to money and the high life. A Gambler is the kind of person you look for when you are out for a good time.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Gambler's life revolves around playing games, wagering on contests, and mixing with high society. The money they earn is nice, but a Gambler knows that both profit and loss are part of their chosen profession. When times are tough, a Gambler is good at concealing the fact that they're strapped for cash. While they're waiting for their next big strike, they rub elbows with the social lions and high rollers around him, always looking for a way to get back in the good graces of Lady Luck.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In order to mingle with those who enjoy fame and fortune, a Gambler uses their skill at deception to get into the best parties and social gatherings. Once they're in the door, they're good at insinuating themselves into the confidence of their newfound friends- without letting on that it's all a ruse. The only thing they care about is lining their pockets.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Gambler Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gamblers spend most of their time either inside the gaming halls of the galaxy's casinos, most often the ones found on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rodia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rodia","referenceId":"reference:431923360713d815"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ord Mantell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ord_Mantell?action=edit&redlink=1"},", or traveling to or from one. When they are not sitting at the sabacc table or watching the jubilee wheel, Gamblers can typically be found schmoozing with the rich and famous. They know where the parties are and know how to get through the front door, or the back door if it comes down to it. A Gambler might also be able to provide a means to get away from local authorities on the next luxury cruise leaving the system- for a price, of course.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Gamblers are good at picking up tidbits of information from their conversations at the game table or from their friends at the latest social event. Always looking for a quick score, Gamblers are willing to offer what they know for a fee. They can help people get into the governor's ball, past the Moff's security detail, or connected with the movers and shakers of society.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Physical violence is the Gambler's bane. Even though a Gambler might be at least halfway decent with a blaster, he prefers to face off against someone in a game rather than a gunfight.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Gambler Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 7\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","